    narr:generatedFrom "e3c75c2df1a4d6b8ce07850fdf733affe72074b3" ;
    narr:narration """Tanya's presence in the graph is entirely review acts, dated and paired with the position each one concerns. She filed [a rejection turning on whether a single-site pilot was ever agreed, dated September 23](narr:Expr_3ReviewEvents70102_4) and, the same day, [a change-request pushback on how sequencing against site friction was framed](narr:Expr_3ReviewEvents70102_3). Days later she [reviewed and rejected a further change](narr:Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_1), recorded again as [the rejection of the change under review](narr:Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_61), attaching questions on [how the minimum soak duration between cutovers gets validated](narr:Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_2) and [how sequencing should resolve when containment conflicts with local friction](narr:Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_60), plus [a note that the revised duration figure is as unmeasured as the one before it](narr:Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_62). Each rejection pairs a decision with a question left open rather than a counter-claim resolved.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_ReviewCommentTanyaTeamownerAfbbdc56Cd2A440EAd0E0_hb725287d6759_60> ;
